---
// Fills the last slot when the project list is short: instead of an empty gap
// that reads as "missing items", the launch story — the fund moves to whatever
// facility is ready next — becomes the third card, and doubles as the partner
// recruitment path. Rendered only where ProjectBrowser is given `teaser`.
---

<a
  href="/apply"
  class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-primary/10 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-lg focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col group h-full"
>
  <div class="h-56 bg-deep flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-gold/40"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-14 -left-8 w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-medium/40"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="relative font-serif italic text-3xl text-white text-center px-6 leading-snug">
      Where next?
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col flex-grow p-7">
    <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Next Deployment</p>
    <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-dark mb-2 leading-snug text-xl">
      The next one could be yours.
    </h3>
    <p class="text-body text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
      We fund the technology, the training, and the ongoing support — partner
      facilities bring the people. If your organization serves trauma-affected
      people, the next deployment on this page could be with you.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-primary/10 flex items-baseline justify-end">
      <span class="text-primary font-bold font-sans text-sm whitespace-nowrap group-hover:text-medium transition-colors">
        Apply for funding →
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</a>
